From: Andrii Sultanov <andriy.sultanov@vates.tech>
Date: Tue, 17 Feb 2026 08:16:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] xenguest: Toggle xc_dom_image->claim_enabled

Signed-off-by: Andrii Sultanov <andriy.sultanov@vates.tech>
---
 tools/xenguest/xenguest_stubs.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/tools/xenguest/xenguest_stubs.c b/tools/xenguest/xenguest_stubs.c
index ed7c4dff39..6f15112898 100644
--- a/tools/xenguest/xenguest_stubs.c
+++ b/tools/xenguest/xenguest_stubs.c
@@ -635,6 +635,7 @@ int stub_xc_pv_build(int c_mem_max_mib, int mem_start_mib,
     dom->console_domid = console_domid;
     dom->xenstore_evtchn = store_evtchn;
     dom->xenstore_domid = store_domid;
+    dom->claim_enabled = 1;
     if ( opt_mem_pnode != XC_NUMA_NO_NODE )
         dom->memflags = XENMEMF_exact_node(opt_mem_pnode);
 
